mented":true,"runtimeText":"同/相邻区域；骰4—6伤1；不能用防御姿态抵挡","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-010":{"id":"basic-010","name":"猴子游戏","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-010","sourceText":"- 由被你指定的人进行判定，若对方摇出单数则扣除对方1点血量。","sourceNotes":"可指定人数未写明。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"攻击","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"相同/相邻区域","type":"attack","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"同区／相邻区选1—3名敌人，各自掷d6，单数受1伤；始终按群体判定。","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-011":{"id":"basic-011","name":"给你加分","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-011","sourceText":"- 所有人打出一张“攻击”牌，若没有，则扣除1点血量（队友一样）。","sourceNotes":"牌面末尾括号未闭合；“所有人”是否包含自己待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["搏击操"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4C","decisions":["forced-delivery"]},"basic-012":{"id":"basic-012","name":"来玩","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-012","sourceText":"- 所有人打出一张“外星”卡牌，否则扣除一点血量（队友一样）。","sourceNotes":"“所有人”是否包含自己待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["搏击操"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4C","decisions":["forced-delivery"]},"basic-013":{"id":"basic-013","name":"跑操","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-013","sourceText":"- 所有人向操场移动一格，最远的人扣除1点血量（队友一样，自己无效）。","sourceNotes":"最远者并列与移动路径待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["搏击操"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["forced-path"]},"basic-014":{"id":"basic-014","name":"樱花舞","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-014","sourceText":"- 所有人打出一张“普通”卡牌，否则扣除一滴血量（队友一样）。","sourceNotes":"“所有人”是否包含自己待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["搏击操"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4C","decisions":["forced-delivery"]},"basic-015":{"id":"basic-015","name":"咖啡","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-015","sourceText":"- 立刻回复8点行动点，但是你下一个回合无法恢复行动点。","sourceNotes":"与行动点上限的关系待确认；素材文件名标签为“帝汝”，牌面词条为“帝汶”；未重命名图片。","printedCost":"0","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":0},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["帝汶"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"增加8AP；跳过下一次整轮AP补充及下次个人开始补点／尚德荟加点。其他卡牌收益照常，重复只刷新标记。","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-016":{"id":"basic-016","name":"橡胶","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-016","sourceText":"- 选定一名角色，和他互换位置。","sourceNotes":"素材文件名标签为“帝汝”，牌面词条为“帝汶”；未重命名图片。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["帝汶"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"选择一名其他存活角色，与其交换位置；遵守免疫、封闭地区与各自禁水限制。","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-017":{"id":"basic-017","name":"插队","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-017","sourceText":"- 直接跳到你的回合，并且刷新回合次数，确定轰炸区和毒圈。","sourceNotes":"中断恢复、补牌加点、环境与次数刷新参见规则裁定，尚未齐全。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["建民"],"printedRange":"可在任意时候打出","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["interrupt-round"]},"basic-018":{"id":"basic-018","name":"断水断电","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-018","sourceText":"- 你可以让一个人下回合不可以摸牌，也不可以恢复行动点（对猴四无效）。","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["建民"],"printedRange":"全地图（云上学府除外）","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["resource-suppression"]},"basic-019":{"id":"basic-019","name":"借我张纸","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-019","sourceText":"- 拿取对方2点行动点。","sourceNotes":"对方不足2点时怎样处理待确认。","printedCost":"0","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":0},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["建民"],"printedRange":"相同/相邻区域","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["insufficient-ap"]},"basic-020":{"id":"basic-020","name":"上厕所","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-020","sourceText":"- 使用后到你的下一个回合，你无法被单体伤害选中。","sourceNotes":"到下回合开始还是结束待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["建民"],"printedRange":"对自身使用","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["single-target-protection"]},"basic-021":{"id":"basic-021","name":"卫汶找你","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-021","sourceText":"- 指定一个人，让对方猜你摇出来的数字，对方猜错则可以把对方传送到任意一个位置。","sourceNotes":"猜测与摇骰先后、数字信息可见性待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["建民"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["hidden-guess"]},"basic-022":{"id":"basic-022","name":"谣言","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-022","sourceText":"- 你可以让一个人下回合不可以出牌。","sourceNotes":"是否禁止响应牌待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["建民"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["play-suppression"]},"basic-023":{"id":"basic-023","name":"占座","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-023","sourceText":"- 对一块区域使用（可以有人），使到你下一个回合内所有人不可进入（对队友无效）。","sourceNotes":"牌面类型写“单体伤害”，正文为区域限制；持续终点待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["建民"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["region-block"]},"basic-024":{"id":"basic-024","name":"转学手册","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-024","sourceText":"- 拿取对方两张手牌或者1张武器/坐骑（可以直接装配，不用行动点，但其特性不变）。","sourceNotes":"选择手牌方式与装备替换待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["建民"],"printedRange":"相同/相邻区域","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["steal-lifecycle"]},"basic-025":{"id":"basic-025","name":"收集石头","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-025","sourceText":"- 摸X张牌（一个回合内可以重复使用）。","sourceNotes":"X的可选范围、是否消耗同一张牌与重复使用费用待确认。","printedCost":"X","cost":{"kind":"variable"},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["普通"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["variable-cost"]},"basic-026":{"id":"basic-026","name":"LMM","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-026","sourceText":"- 收所有人一张牌，没有手牌的角色扣一点血量。若此作，下回合的单体伤害只可对你使用。【最高等级】（队友无效）","sourceNotes":"自身是否交牌、下回合强制选中范围待确认；费用按用户要求保留牌面写法，不解释选档方式。","printedCost":"1/2/3","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[1,2,3]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["lmm-priority"]},"basic-027":{"id":"basic-027","name":"第三只手","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-027","sourceText":"- 使用后抵消另一张锦囊效果。","sourceNotes":"多档费用、响应顺序待确认。","printedCost":"0/1/2","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[0,1,2]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4C","decisions":["counter-stack"]},"basic-028":{"id":"basic-028","name":"高唐判官","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-028","sourceText":"- 对一个使用“建民”卡牌的玩家使用，无效其卡牌效果并且扣除其一点血量。","sourceNotes":"多档及负行动点费用含义待确认。","printedCost":"-1/0/1","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[-1,0,1]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4C","decisions":["counter-stack","negative-cost"]},"basic-029":{"id":"basic-029","name":"化猴","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-029","sourceText":"- 将一名角色改为猴子阵营。","sourceNotes":"是否同步改队伍/胜利归属、持续时间、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"4/5/6","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[4,5,6]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["faction-change"]},"basic-030":{"id":"basic-030","name":"化汶","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-030","sourceText":"- 将一名角色改为帝汶阵营。","sourceNotes":"是否同步改队伍/胜利归属、持续时间、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"4/5/6","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[4,5,6]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["faction-change"]},"basic-031":{"id":"basic-031","name":"上课铃","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-031","sourceText":"- 所有人向“教学楼”移动三格（直到进入）。移动结束后，所有处在教学楼内的人给你一点行动点和一张手牌，没有其中一项，则扣除1点血量（队友无效）。","sourceNotes":"“直到进入”与三格上限、自己是否受影响、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"3/4","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[3,4]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["forced-path"]},"basic-032":{"id":"basic-032","name":"王漠","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-032","sourceText":"- 将1块区域变为沙漠。所有停留/经过的人都要向你上交一张手牌或一点行动点，否则则扣除一点血量。","sourceNotes":"地形持续、经过/停留触发频次、自己是否受影响、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"2/3/4","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[2,3,4]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["terrain-overlay"]},"basic-033":{"id":"basic-033","name":"汶泽","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-033","sourceText":"- 将一块区域变为水域。","sourceNotes":"地形持续、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"1/2/3","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[1,2,3]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["terrain-overlay"]},"basic-034":{"id":"basic-034","name":"移家","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-034","sourceText":"- 将自己移出地图，不可以被任何技能/手牌/轰炸区/毒圈选中，到下一个回合，自己选择出生地。【最高等级】","sourceNotes":"“选择出生地”的范围、回归时点、费用确定方式待确认。","printedCost":"1-6","cost":{"kind":"die","min":1,"max":6},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["off-map"]},"basic-035":{"id":"basic-035","name":"约谈","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-035","sourceText":"- 去除其身上的“化猴”效果。","sourceNotes":"恢复何种阵营、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"2/3/4","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[2,3,4]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["faction-change"]},"basic-036":{"id":"basic-036","name":"樟脑丸","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-036","sourceText":"- 去除其身上的“化汶”效果。","sourceNotes":"恢复何种阵营、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"2/3/4","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[2,3,4]},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4D","decisions":["faction-change"]},"basic-037":{"id":"basic-037","name":"紫檀木","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-037","sourceText":"- 复活一名刚死亡的角色（不超过一个回合）。","sourceNotes":"复活血量/地点、死亡窗口与费用确定方式待确认。","printedCost":"1-6","cost":{"kind":"die","min":1,"max":6},"subtype":"锦囊","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"tactic","copies":1,"proposedCopies":1,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"复活死亡后尚未跨过一个完整个人回合结束的角色：1HP、0AP、空手，固定出生地区随机空格。d6费用按实体牌锁定至本个人回合结束，取消不重掷。","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-038":{"id":"basic-038","name":"芦荟水","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-038","sourceText":"- 阻止另外一个食物的效果，并且自身恢复1点血量。","sourceNotes":"响应时机待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["帝汶"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4C","decisions":["counter-stack"]},"basic-039":{"id":"basic-039","name":"奈雪","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-039","sourceText":"- 回复1点血量。","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"食物","tags":["帝汶"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"food","copies":4,"proposedCopies":4,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"自己回复1生命","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-040":{"id":"basic-040","name":"茜帝","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-040","sourceText":"- 所有帝汶家族恢复1点血量，西帝汶回满。","sourceNotes":"回满的生命上限按角色规则裁定。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["帝汶"],"printedRange":"全地图","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["family-membership"]},"basic-041":{"id":"basic-041","name":"阿萨姆","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-041","sourceText":"- 自己和队友回复一点血量。","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"相同/相邻区域","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"自己及同区／相邻区的存活队友各回复1生命；各自为战只回复自己。","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-042":{"id":"basic-042","name":"冰红茶","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-042","sourceText":"- 回复1点血量。下一次“肘击”和“牢大”一样打出（不需要消耗行动点）。","sourceNotes":"“和牢大一样打出”的具体机制待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["elbow-buff"]},"basic-043":{"id":"basic-043","name":"盖浇","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-043","sourceText":"- 回复1点血量。下一次“躲避球”百分之百命中，伤害+1。【最高等级】","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["guaranteed-hit"]},"basic-044":{"id":"basic-044","name":"农夫三拳","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-044","sourceText":"- 回复1点血量。下次使用搏击操时不需要消耗行动点（别人对你使用也是一样）。","sourceNotes":"“别人对你使用也是一样”涉及谁免付费用待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自身使用","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["exercise-buff"]},"basic-045":{"id":"basic-045","name":"水果","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-045","sourceText":"- 回复1点血量+1点护盾。","sourceNotes":"护盾持续、抵扣顺序待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"自己回复1生命，再获得1护盾（上限2）","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-046":{"id":"basic-046","name":"外星人","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-046","sourceText":"- 回复2点血量。","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"自己回复2生命","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-047":{"id":"basic-047","name":"营养快线","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-047","sourceText":"- 回复1点血量，摸2张牌。","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"food","copies":4,"proposedCopies":4,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"自己回复1生命，再摸2张","milestone":"4B","decisions":[]},"basic-048":{"id":"basic-048","name":"油泼","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-048","sourceText":"- 由你进行判定：1-5回满血；6扣除自己1点血量。","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"食物","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"food","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4B","decisions":["damage-order"]},"basic-049":{"id":"basic-049","name":"帝汶斗篷","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-049","sourceText":"- 披风：当别人使用躲避球对你生效后，你可以进行判定，若为单数，则此躲避球失效。","sourceNotes":"生效后撤销伤害的结算顺序待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"武器（身）","tags":["帝汶"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"body","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["cloak-timing"]},"basic-050":{"id":"basic-050","name":"杭高校服","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-050","sourceText":"- 气场压迫：和你同区域的人每回合扣除一点血量（队友无效）（教学楼内无效）。","sourceNotes":"触发时点、多档装备费用待确认。","printedCost":"1/2/3","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[1,2,3]},"subtype":"武器（身）","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"body","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["uniform-trigger"]},"basic-051":{"id":"basic-051","name":"正装","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-051","sourceText":"- 善良高贵：你每次受到伤害都可以反伤一点（轰炸区/毒圈无效）。【特性：易碎，只可以使用3次，自动报废】","sourceNotes":"反伤目标、次数消耗和自动报废时点、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"1/2/3","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[1,2,3]},"subtype":"武器（身）","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"body","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["reflect-lifecycle"]},"basic-052":{"id":"basic-052","name":"粉笔","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-052","sourceText":"- 粉尘攻击：消耗1个行动点，本次造成的伤害+1（一次攻击只能使用一次）（可以在造成伤害后使用）。\n- 落幕：你失去此装备，可以对场上任意一个人造成一点伤害。","sourceNotes":"伤害后追加时机、群体攻击加伤范围、多档装备费用待确认。","printedCost":"1/2/3","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[1,2,3]},"subtype":"武器（手）","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"hand","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["chalk-trigger"]},"basic-053":{"id":"basic-053","name":"校医的扣分单","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-053","sourceText":"- 心理伤害：你的攻击为真伤。","sourceNotes":"真伤与免疫/护盾关系、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"2/3","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[2,3]},"subtype":"武器（手）","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"hand","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["damage-order"]},"basic-054":{"id":"basic-054","name":"爆浆冰淇淋面包","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-054","sourceText":"- 黏稠：消耗2行动点，使1名角色跳过出牌（2回合1次）。\n- 好吃：失去此装备时，你可以回复2点血量。","sourceNotes":"技能目标距离、跳过出牌范围、两回合计数待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"武器（手）","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"hand","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"装备于手。主动付2AP使全图一名其他角色下次个人回合不能主动出牌，仍能移动、技能和响应；自己第二次个人开始才可再用。失去时可回复2生命。","milestone":"4E","decisions":[]},"basic-055":{"id":"basic-055","name":"冰糖雪梨","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-055","sourceText":"- 糖：对你造成伤害/被你造成伤害的角色扣除1行动点（对方没有行动点则失效）。","sourceNotes":"连续/群体伤害触发次数待确认。","printedCost":"2","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":2},"subtype":"武器（手）","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"hand","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["sugar-trigger"]},"basic-056":{"id":"basic-056","name":"高宇涛","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-056","sourceText":"- 不可阻挡：你的躲避球不是“6”就生效，且不可以“帝汶斗篷”所阻挡。","sourceNotes":"末句保留原文语法。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"武器（手）","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"hand","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["guaranteed-hit"]},"basic-057":{"id":"basic-057","name":"花露水","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-057","sourceText":"- 字面意思：你不可以被指定为“吸血”的目标。","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"武器（手）","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"hand","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":[]},"basic-058":{"id":"basic-058","name":"王烨超","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-058","sourceText":"- Bling Bling：你的卡牌距离+1。","sourceNotes":"“+1”的距离单位与适用牌待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"武器（头）","tags":["普通"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"head","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["range-bonus"]},"basic-059":{"id":"basic-059","name":"眼镜","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-059","sourceText":"- 智慧：你受伤上限为1点。\n- 武装：你失去它时可以恢复1点血量。","sourceNotes":"伤害上限适用范围、多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"1/2","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[1,2]},"subtype":"武器（头）","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"head","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["damage-order"]},"basic-060":{"id":"basic-060","name":"手表","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-060","sourceText":"- 回溯时间：回到上回和刚开始的位置（1回合1次）。","sourceNotes":"“上回和”为牌面原文，疑似笔误；目标回合、技能费用、多档装备费用待确认。","printedCost":"1/2","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[1,2]},"subtype":"武器（腕）","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"wrist","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["watch-return"]},"basic-061":{"id":"basic-061","name":"植物","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-061","sourceText":"- 致命打击：你对别人造成伤害后，可以把他传送到“云上学府”/“高唐农场”。","sourceNotes":"多档费用待确认。","printedCost":"1/2/3","cost":{"kind":"tiers","values":[1,2,3]},"subtype":"武器（腕）","tags":["神秘"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"wrist","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["plant-teleport"]},"basic-062":{"id":"basic-062","name":"通哥","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-062","sourceText":"- 停滞：被你攻击到的角色下回合不可以移动（一定要对其造成伤害）。","sourceNotes":"主动与被动移动是否都禁止待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"武器（腕）","tags":["外星"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"wrist","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["movement-suppression"]},"basic-063":{"id":"basic-063","name":"哈基米","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-063","sourceText":"- 身躯强大：无视面包车，但是不可以下水，失去后可以传送到“山洞”。","sourceNotes":"无视范围待确认。","printedCost":"0","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":0},"subtype":"坐骑","tags":["帝汶"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"mount","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"无视面包车；不能下水，失去时可传送至山洞空格。","milestone":"4E","decisions":[]},"basic-064":{"id":"basic-064","name":"面包车","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-064","sourceText":"- 横冲直撞：停留地同行/同列的所有人扣除1点血量（队友无效），但是你不可以过水。","sourceNotes":"触发时点、频次、自身是否受影响待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"坐骑","tags":["帝汶"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"mount","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["van-trigger"]},"basic-065":{"id":"basic-065","name":"承汉骑","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-065","sourceText":"- 体力充沛：你的卡牌行动点没有上限。","sourceNotes":"“卡牌行动点没有上限”指行动点总量还是用牌限制待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"坐骑","tags":["普通"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"mount","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["ap-unlimited"]},"basic-066":{"id":"basic-066","name":"等一羊","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-066","sourceText":"- 等一下：你若是上一个回合没有主动移动，那么你这一个回合可以移动两次，且移动距离即为摇出的点数。","sourceNotes":"首回合是否触发、两次移动是否各判定待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"坐骑","tags":["普通"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"mount","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"首个个人回合无加成；上个个人回合没用基础移动，本次可移动两次，各掷d6使用完整点数。","milestone":"4E","decisions":[]},"basic-067":{"id":"basic-067","name":"高胜胜牌小白马","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-067","sourceText":"- 王子权威：你若是这一个回合没有移动，那么直到下一个回合，所有拥有坐骑的玩家都无法主动移动。","sourceNotes":"生效时点、是否包含自己待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"坐骑","tags":["普通"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"mount","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":true,"implemented":true,"runtimeText":"个人回合结束时，若本回合没有任何主动位移，其他有坐骑者至你下次开始前不能主动位移。","milestone":"4E","decisions":[]},"basic-068":{"id":"basic-068","name":"关烁（本人）","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-068","sourceText":"- 实名上网：若是他人进入你的区域/对你造成伤害，你可以移动一步。","sourceNotes":"频次与移动费用待确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subtype":"坐骑","tags":["普通"],"printedRange":"对自己使用","type":"equipment","slot":"mount","copies":2,"proposedCopies":2,"inherited":false,"implemented":false,"runtimeText":null,"milestone":"4E","decisions":["reactive-step"]},"basic-069":{"id":"basic-069","name":"唐车","source":"docs/cards/基础牌.md#basic-069","sourceText":"- 轮椅：你可以选择性的无视地形所有效果（包括沙漠）。","sourceNotes":"未发现此牌的额外文字缺项；通用规则仍见索引，不表示完整裁定已确认。","printedCost":"1","cost":{"kind":"fixed","value":1},"subty